{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Deer Hero&quot;</strong> is an expansive 2D <strong>chaos-and-death action game</strong>. In this chaotic world, find your way by <strong>dying over and over!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face 80+ tough stages with 30+ skills &amp; weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the deer hero, <strong>Ererere,</strong> and embark on an adventure to end the war between the Elementals and Humans! Ererere wields various weapons to face formidable enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By clearing short stages, you can acquire new weapons and skills, transforming into an ever more <strong>stylish deer warrior.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At times, terrifying bullet hell may rain down upon you, but with your own unique strategy, victory is within reach!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Start of Battle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/20bad932283d46a52f2cbde2ba0a7db645263a17.jpg"},{"name":"Destined Enemy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/a3e4840f5b8055486fe3282226897fca728f82ab.jpg"},{"name":"Upepe-Style Sorcery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/d30e2f7ad811ca2c1424f0b830daad0d754df471.jpg"},{"name":"Netro-Style Weaponry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/f0818527cccc5e0e7ccb5e619963a24330bdba7d.jpg"},{"name":"Defeat the magician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/05c6dab74faaf59d7176a9ab3a2bbd5895c4d09e.jpg"},{"name":"Deer Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/a0647c0116b6384b0e485ea6c39b00d8f2b25614.jpg"},{"name":"Return of Teacher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3264930/097a2b59dc4afc09c8ad574ba4ea91f0ddec77f3.jpg"},{"n